["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 創始人陳冕×羅永浩！且讓我大鬧一場，然後悄然離去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年內不會讓人類沒用：這是陳冕押上全部身家的賭注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年內學不會人類的品味和判斷，像Lovart這樣需要人介入的設計產品就還有價值；一旦判斷錯，公司也會跟著完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus決定出售前最後的訪談：啊，這奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 決定出售前最後訪談：AI 沒有蠻荒期，因為沒新平臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移動互聯網的蠻荒期來自硬件換代，桌面到手機讓巨頭和個人開發者眾生平等；AI 技術突破更大，卻沒有出現全新平臺，所以巨頭、創業公司、個人開發者反應一樣快，蠻荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季報跨年對談：和廣密預言一場AI War、兩大聯盟和第三個範式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨頭砸光最後一分錢也不下牌桌的戰爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 泡沫，是拿商業回報算出來的賬；巨頭把它當成新的國防或核武器，算的是被顛覆的風險——所以寧可砸光最後一分錢，也不輕易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和紅杉鄭慶生聊：經濟史的流量革命、人類行為模式的不可預期，與創始人性格 雙邊網絡效應 PMF 倖存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的網絡沒有自然壟斷，邊際成本不趨近於零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網產品是巨大的城鎮，邊際成本趨近於零所以贏家通吃；AI 每多一個用戶就多一份 token 成本，這個差別會改寫流量節點的商業設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投資札記第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美國資本壞小孩、算盤與泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商業模式是負向滾雪球，越燒越虧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的訓練成本乘以十去燒下一代模型，收入卻只按上一年的兩倍回收，加 2 減 10，現金流年年更負。只有停止燒錢那天，利潤表才會突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的創投觀察第1集：2026年預期、The Year of R、回調、我們如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回報之年：模型沒有秘密，應用才有護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力進步在放緩，中國開源模型把差距壓到 6-12 個月，API 生意沒有壟斷性壁壘；真正值錢的是模型之外那層 context、工具和環境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"123. 對ONE2X創始人王冠3小時訪談：生成系統、沒有中間商賺差價、內容平臺的權力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的公司最終都是生成系統公司，中間商會被幹掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網平臺靠分配權剝削生產端，同樣的內容不同人發量不一樣，說明分配機制失效。生成系統把分配內化，直接連接需求和生產，產銷合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系統</span><span class=\"tag\">數據飛輪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"MiniMax 創始人閆俊傑×羅永浩！大山並非無法翻越 Scaling Law AGI Exploration/Exploitation MOE OpenRouter\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-10-cn2d7912-缩放定律最早在百度被发现-但做出gpt的却是美国公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ffd4880abb9af1d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>縮放定律最早在百度被發現，但做出GPT的卻是美國公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MiniMax創始人嚴俊傑說，奠定大模型根基的縮放定律2014年就已經在百度被發現，但真正做出GPT的卻是沒有歷史包袱的美國創業公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">成本結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"122. 朱嘯虎現實主義故事的第三次連載：人工智能的盛筵與泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年內看不到泡沫，但 VC 共識太集中才是真風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說泡沫論是二級市場投資人在故意引導回調，真正的問題是一級市場每個項目都成了 Club Deal，GP 賺不了大錢、LP 也不開心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"121. 對DeepMind譚捷的訪談：機器人、跨本體、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>機器人最大的瓶頸不是算法，是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">譚捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年機器人，他的判斷是：機器人基座模型至今還不是獨立學科，只是多模態大模型的微調；真正的瓶頸是數據，而搖操採數據不是終局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"120. 小鵬新上任的劉先明首次訪談：Language是毒藥、拆掉L、簡單即美、換帥、小鵬的AI轉型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鵬拆掉語言模型：Language 是毒藥，簡單即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬自動駕駛新負責人劉先明把 VLA 裡的 Language 拆掉，用 27 萬到 30 萬小時純視覺數據直接輸出控制信號，因為 Language 是離散的、低效的，會成為數據規模化的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和楊松琳考古算法變種史，並預演未來架構改進方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>純線性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共識</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限無保證；Kimi、千問都收斂到每 3 層線性插 1 層全局注意力，而 MiniMax 從 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因為評測漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"118. 對李想的第二次3小時訪談：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文鋒、VLA、能量、記憶、對抗人性、親密關係、人類的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年內不會出現，只會先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷通用 agent 五年內不會出現，真正會出現的是 agentOS——各專業在上面開發自己的專業 agent。因為生產工具必須能行動、能替代專業工作，而不是給個建議。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"117. 開源一段論文探索之旅：模型範式、Infra和數據、語言、多模態的完整變遷史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠：第一階段的贏家不是最後的贏家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商業史上第一波跑出來的公司幾乎從不是下個階段的贏家。模型公司是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">論文精讀</span><span class=\"tag\">模型範式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"名創優品葉國富×羅永浩！重塑線下購物，讓人們重新愛上逛街！ SKU fine dining\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-22-cn2d7912-名创优品老板-超市只分两种-卖产品的活-卖货架的死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c387de8b2a7bb5e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>名創優品老闆：超市只分兩種，賣產品的活，賣貨架的死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">葉國富說，山姆和胖東來靠做好產品活下來，其他超市靠進場費、上架費賺錢，這套邏輯正是他收購永輝、複製胖東來模式的全部依據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線下零售</span><span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"116. 吳明輝口述19年史：漫長的沉浮、痛苦急轉、企業級Agentic Model、現實世界的數值遊戲、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基礎模型只要有兩家以上就不可能賺錢，會像電價一樣被捲成電費；真正的壁壘是別人沒存下來的 context 數據，以及大廠因為晉升機制永遠做不了的最後一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業級AI</span><span class=\"tag\">數據壁壘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"周鴻禕×羅永浩！周鴻禕深度談 AI！近四小時高密度輸出 AGI PMF MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-24-cn2d7912-ai没法像互联网一样免费-因为token成本只增不减/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/244c36d13df4d6ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:32:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI沒法像互聯網一樣免費，因為token成本只增不減</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做一個10分鐘視頻要燒掉約1000萬token、花10到20塊錢——周鴻禕認為任務越複雜AI的邊際成本越高，靠廣告或免費換規模的老路走不通，收費是遲早的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI商業模式</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"115. 對OpenAI姚順雨3小時訪談：6年Agent研究、人與系統、吞噬的邊界、既單極又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半場：通用方法已經有了，難的是找任務</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚順雨說 AI 主線已從「造武器」進入「選戰場」——方法終於通用了，但真正的瓶頸不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人腦子裡的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"114. 與殷一、歐迪聊聊薩洛蒙：中國意外的增長閥門、小眾越野跑與少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年沒變，薩洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國越野跑核心人群十年前十萬人，今年還是十萬人，區別是老了十歲。薩洛蒙沒丟專業線，靠女性拉新把會員從十萬做到八百萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">戶外運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何廣智×羅永浩！何廣智：我到長安了 callback cue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-01-cn2d7912-何广智-做好人比做坏人容易-因为伪装太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c82a199f8115741a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>何廣智：做好人比做壞人容易，因為偽裝太難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何廣智說：選擇當好人不是天性，是算準了做好事幾乎必有回報，而當壞人必須八面玲瓏、不能露一絲破綻，門檻太高、太難偽裝了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">創作方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"113. 和楊植麟時隔1年的對話：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之腦和“站在無限的開端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像訓模型：SFT 太多，團隊就沒有創造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟楊植麟講：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告訴人該怎麼做，太多，人就沒有主觀能動性；RL 只給獎勵，但獎勵定義不好，全隊都會去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何小鵬×羅永浩！何小鵬講述從財富自由奔赴無盡地獄模式的創業故事 soul side Tops\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-26-cn2d7912-何小鹏-造车十年-没有一家中国车企真正拿到船票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f6e10cb84ed08b87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：造車十年，沒有一家中國車企真正拿到船票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何小鵬說中國新能源車的淘汰賽大概五年內見分曉，最後大概留下五家，但眼下每一家、包括小鵬自己，都還沒拿到那張船票。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">造車新勢力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研發投入</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×羅永浩！四小時馬拉松訪談！李想首度公開講述 25 年創業之路 GTD PHEV e-power\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-19-cn2d7912-李想-顶级企业家共同点不是选得准-而是反人性高频迭代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9a33a06a8261b5e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:56:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>李想：頂級企業家共同點不是選得準，而是反人性高頻迭代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說頂級企業家選對賽道、能長期堅持只是入場門檻，真正拉開差距的是黃仁勳、字節、美團那種反人性的高頻市場迭代速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>"]